You maybe didn't wear your pantyhose, but you also didn't think to bring a beverage into the room.

624
00:28:37.260 --> 00:28:38.300
Oh, my gosh.

625
00:28:38.700 --> 00:28:43.320
Well, I guess I kind of have memories of Pam holding her mug, but I couldn't believe it.

626
00:28:43.420 --> 00:28:44.300
They both had mugs.

627
00:28:44.400 --> 00:28:44.940
I was jealous.

628
00:28:45.180 --> 00:28:48.500
Oh, John and I were all over the how can we drink coffee at work.

629
00:28:48.880 --> 00:28:50.220
So, yeah, don't worry.

