00:34:06.900 --> 00:34:07.420
Mm-hmm.

748
00:34:07.780 --> 00:34:11.820
But then that leads to, do you want to go clubbing with me in New York?

749
00:34:11.980 --> 00:34:13.200
Because they're both single.

750
00:34:13.420 --> 00:34:13.680
Right.

751
00:34:14.020 --> 00:34:16.460
And Jim's like, I'm dating Pam.

752
00:34:16.660 --> 00:34:18.940
And Michael says, oh, that's still going on?

753
00:34:19.380 --> 00:34:19.860
What?

754
00:34:21.860 --> 00:34:24.440
So, of course, now Michael has to enlist Dwight.

755
00:34:25.080 --> 00:34:26.640
And Andy wants to go.

756
00:34:26.880 --> 00:34:31.200
He says the old ball and chain has been more chain than ball lately, if you know what I

757
00:34:31.200 --> 00:34:31.380
mean.

