00:34:31.480 --> 00:34:33.380
I don't know what that means, but it grossed me out.

759
00:34:33.640 --> 00:34:35.940
And Angela says, I'm right here.

760
00:34:36.160 --> 00:34:36.600
Jenna?

761
00:34:36.840 --> 00:34:36.980
Yeah.

762
00:34:37.180 --> 00:34:38.560
